        "@value": "{\"kind\":\"statement\",\"modality\":\"not_stated\",\"summary\":\"A determination made by the Secretary regarding whether a limitation on the placement or operation of a vending facility is justified shall be binding on any department, agency, or instrumentality of the United States affected by such determination.\"}",
