        "@value": "{\"kind\":\"exemption\",\"modality\":\"not_required\",\"scope_text\":\"when the Secretary and the State licensing agency determine that the number of people using the property is or will be insufficient to support a vending facility\",\"summary\":\"The provisions of 20 U.S.C. 107a(d)(1) shall not apply when the Secretary and the State licensing agency determine that the number of people using the property is or will be insufficient to support a vending facility.\"}",
